WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:11.789
In tutorial 8.11, you'll see how AI
describes you, whether it can read your site,

00:00:11.839 --> 00:00:13.484
and what its visitors are worth.

00:00:14.525 --> 00:00:19.490
First, near the top of AI visibility,
see how many assistants know your brand,

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:23.059
and how often Google shows an
AI Overview for your searches.

00:00:24.109 --> 00:00:28.474
Further down, What AI visits are worth
shows the visits AI answers send you,

00:00:28.524 --> 00:00:33.618
and the key events they lead to. If you
track sales, revenue shows here too.

00:00:34.548 --> 00:00:37.423
Below that, see the visits
from each assistant,

00:00:37.473 --> 00:00:40.379
and the pages people
land on from AI answers.

00:00:41.392 --> 00:00:45.592
Next, How AI describes you shows the
tone of the answers that name you,

00:00:45.642 --> 00:00:47.450
and the words AI uses for you.

00:00:48.484 --> 00:00:52.009
Negative answers shows where
an assistant spoke against you.

00:00:52.059 --> 00:00:55.409
What AI gets wrong lists claims
that don't match your business.

00:00:55.459 --> 00:00:57.998
Here, one says you're based in Dubai.

00:00:58.972 --> 00:01:01.847
To put it right, click
Check the business profile,

00:01:01.897 --> 00:01:04.589
and make sure your address
and other details are right.

00:01:06.997 --> 00:01:10.122
Then, under Business details,
state your real facts,

00:01:10.172 --> 00:01:14.472
like years in business and
certifications. Your pages quote them,

00:01:14.522 --> 00:01:16.109
and never invent numbers.

00:01:17.093 --> 00:01:20.163
Back on AI visibility,
Can AI read your site?

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:24.663
checks that each AI crawler, the bot
an assistant sends to read pages,

00:01:24.713 --> 00:01:29.180
is allowed in. If one is blocked,
How to open the door shows the fix.

00:01:30.081 --> 00:01:34.678
Market-wide compares your share with your
competitors' across far more questions

00:01:34.678 --> 00:01:38.068
than you track, shows answers
that name you without a link,

00:01:38.068 --> 00:01:40.252
and real questions where AI cites you.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:44.142
Finally, see what AI
searched before answering,

00:01:44.192 --> 00:01:47.653
and add any of the Questions worth
tracking to your panel with Track.

00:01:49.267 --> 00:01:52.692
So you know what AI says about
you, whether it can read your site,

00:01:52.742 --> 00:01:54.479
and what its visitors are worth.

00:01:55.509 --> 00:02:00.594
So, see what AI visits are worth, read
how AI describes you, put the facts right,

00:02:00.644 --> 00:02:04.418
check AI can read your site, compare
the market, and add questions.

00:02:05.438 --> 00:02:08.038
Now you know where you
stand in AI answers.

00:02:08.088 --> 00:02:11.520
Next, check your
backlinks in tutorial 9.1.
